    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Left By Angels - Based on the real Left By Angels Mansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A descent into guilt, grief, and the unknown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/ae7583ebdc8429359d1cd1fc5781feee.avif?t=1751727280\" width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your wife vanishes without explanation, her face resurfaces\u2014captured in the shattered window of a long-abandoned mansion by urban explorers. The footage makes national headlines. You follow the only lead you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building isn\u2019t in ruins\u2026 It\u2019s pristine. Alive. Trapped inside, you uncover echoes of a life you thought was gone, twisted and changed. She is here. She speaks. And she demands answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did you do this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/3ad07b9dc3196c6f40416a5bc9b3135d.avif?t=1751727280\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dark, story-driven psychological horror where nothing is what it seems, and everything is personal. Step into a nightmare shaped by regret and deceit, where the past refuses to stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/963de42eba1ddf8dc0e08fbfbbe217d0.avif?t=1751727280\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Explore a richly detailed world through a deeply immersive perspective. Discover, survive, and confront what you\u2019re not ready to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light is Survival</strong> \u2013 Use your flashlight and limited battery supply to navigate pitch-black corridors. Capture moments and uncover hidden truths with your photo camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong> \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles, discover secrets, and piece together a broken story through exploration and memory fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping Reality</strong> \u2013 The mansion changes with every step. Time loops, rooms shift, and logic breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.poster.avif?t=1751727280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.webm?t=1751727280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.mp4?t=1751727280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Story</strong> \u2013 She knows everything. Relive what she endured. Walk through her pain. Unravel the truth\u2014layer by disturbing layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left By Angels</strong> is a narrative-driven horror experience blending supernatural elements, environmental storytelling, and surreal loops to deliver a terrifying and emotional journey through guilt and revelation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Left By Angels - Based on the real Left By Angels Mansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A descent into guilt, grief, and the unknown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/ae7583ebdc8429359d1cd1fc5781feee.avif?t=1751727280\" width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your wife vanishes without explanation, her face resurfaces\u2014captured in the shattered window of a long-abandoned mansion by urban explorers. The footage makes national headlines. You follow the only lead you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building isn\u2019t in ruins\u2026 It\u2019s pristine. Alive. Trapped inside, you uncover echoes of a life you thought was gone, twisted and changed. She is here. She speaks. And she demands answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did you do this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/3ad07b9dc3196c6f40416a5bc9b3135d.avif?t=1751727280\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dark, story-driven psychological horror where nothing is what it seems, and everything is personal. Step into a nightmare shaped by regret and deceit, where the past refuses to stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/963de42eba1ddf8dc0e08fbfbbe217d0.avif?t=1751727280\" data-has-big width=800 height=296 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Explore a richly detailed world through a deeply immersive perspective. Discover, survive, and confront what you\u2019re not ready to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light is Survival</strong> \u2013 Use your flashlight and limited battery supply to navigate pitch-black corridors. Capture moments and uncover hidden truths with your photo camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong> \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles, discover secrets, and piece together a broken story through exploration and memory fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looping Reality</strong> \u2013 The mansion changes with every step. Time loops, rooms shift, and logic breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.poster.avif?t=1751727280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.webm?t=1751727280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720950/extras/4c88ab5bbc1b41e9c5621681cbc02da3.mp4?t=1751727280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Story</strong> \u2013 She knows everything. Relive what she endured. Walk through her pain. Unravel the truth\u2014layer by disturbing layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left By Angels</strong> is a narrative-driven horror experience blending supernatural elements, environmental storytelling, and surreal loops to deliver a terrifying and emotional journey through guilt and revelation.</p>",
